@title S2 EP 02 • GOSSIP HARDER
@bg party_house_night
@show riley
Riley: First party of the season! House rules: no crying before midnight, no texting exes, no—
@show nia
Nia: Riley, you've broken every one of those rules already.
Riley: I'm setting an example of what not to do. It's leadership.
Across the room, Nicole and Valentina are talking to the same baseball player. Neither is smiling anymore.
> [Bold] Walk over and pull Valentina away. -> p_bold
> [Sweet] Get Nicole a drink and change the subject. -> p_sweet
> [Bad] Record it. Maya will pay. -> p_bad
> [Good] Text Simone: "Code red, kitchen." -> p_good
*p_bold
@add Valentina_Friendship 1
@add Nicole_Friendship 1
Valentina: Ugh, FINE. But only because your outfit is cute.
@jump p_done
*p_sweet
@add Nicole_Friendship 2
Nicole: (exhaling) Thank you. I was about to say something I'd regret on a Monday.
@jump p_done
*p_bad
@add Drama 2
@add Maya_Friendship 2
@add Nicole_Friendship -2
By morning, three teams have seen it. Nicole knows exactly who filmed it.
@jump p_done
*p_good
@add Simone_Friendship 2
Simone arrives like a bouncer with a ponytail. Crisis averted. For now.
*p_done
@load s2/ep03.mvs
